# PETAL PARADE: like Magic Garden, a run is never saved half-way. Quitting
# puts its score on the board, and the title only starts a new run. A save
# from the first version keeps its best score.
game petalparade
wait 20
cheat old_save
expect hi0 == 4321
press A
expect state == 1
cheat clear
cheat score 1234
cheat saved 42
reload
game petalparade
wait 20
expect state == 0
expect hi0 == 4321
expect hi1 == 1234
expect hi2 == 0
press A
expect state == 1
expect score == 0
expect saved == 0
